Video recording of legislative meetings. 25LSO-0512, 1.1
FISCAL NOTE
No significant fiscal or personnel impact.
The Legislative Service Office (LSO) currently broadcasts legislative meetings
live and posts the video recordings on the legislative website. The LSO can carry
out the requirements of this bill within its current budget.
